=== apartment ===
Eli's apartment is tidy in the way of a person who expects visitors and trusts none of them.

* [Inspect the desk]
    The draft column names a reviewer who has been selling five-star opinions. The name is half-covered by a coffee stain.
    -> apartment
* [Inspect the medicine packet]
    The packet is ordinary cold medicine. It is not aconite. It is also the reason Dan remembers being here once.
    -> apartment
* [Inspect the keys]
    A café key is missing from the ring. Sasha says she came to collect it. The absence is consistent with her story.
    -> apartment
* [Leave the apartment]
    -> END
